    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d508">

                <pb facs="0575" n="525" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg525"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            White.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-05-17"><hi rendition="#italic">May 17,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Representations made here that Russian Government is about to enforce edict
                    against Jews, which will result in a large emigration of destitute people of
                    that class to the United States.</p>
                <p>If there is foundation for what we hear, you will please ascertain and report as
                    speedily as possible the terms of the edict and its probable effect.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
